### ============================================================================
### Company.http — Company CRUD requests (SysAdmin only).
###
### Prerequisites:
### 1. Get a JWT token by running Login from Auth.http.
### 2. Paste the token into http-client.env.json.
### 3. The logged-in user must have the SysAdmin role.
### ============================================================================


### ============================================================================
### Get All Companies
### GET /api/company — Returns all companies (SysAdmin only).
### ============================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/company
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================================================
### Get Companies Paged
### GET /api/company/paged — Paginated list with optional search filter.
### ============================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/company/paged?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================================================
### Create Company
### POST /api/company — Creates a new company/issuer (SysAdmin only).
### Minimal required fields: companyName + registrationNumber.
### Address, Contact, BankAccount are optional but recommended.
### ============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/company
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "companyName": "Test Company s.r.o.",
  "registrationNumber": "12345678",
  "taxNumber": "CZ12345678",
  "isVatPayer": true,
  "isIssuer": true,
  "fetchFromAres": false,
  "address": [
    {
      "street": "Testovací 123",
      "city": "Praha",
      "zipCode": "11000",
      "country": "CZ",
      "addressType": "Billing"
    }
  ],
  "contact": [
    {
      "email": "info@testcompany.cz",
      "phone": "+420123456789",
      "contactType": "Primary"
    }
  ],
  "bankAccount": [
    {
      "bankName": "Test Banka",
      "accountNumber": "1234567890",
      "bankCode": "0100",
      "iban": "CZ6508000000001234567890",
      "isDefault": true
    }
  ],
  "billingSettings": {
    "dueDays": 14,
    "invoicePrefix": "FV",
    "creditNotePrefix": "DN",
    "paymentMethod": "BankTransfer"
  }
}

### ============================================================================
### Get Company by ID
### GET /api/company/{id} — Returns a specific company by ID.
### ============================================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/company/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
